txtql::lint::nested_repetition

  ⚠ nested unlimited repetition
   ╭─[query.tql:2:8]
 1 │ -- Found by fuzzing: the lint on the nested repetition used to hide the empty-loop error.
 2 │ TEXT = 0 TO n (0 TO n (0 TO n WORD))
   ·        ───┬──  ───┬──
   ·           │       ╰── inner repetition
   ·           ╰── outer repetition
   ╰────
  help: `1 TO n (1 TO n x)` can split the text in exponentially many ways; add a separator or a
        literal to anchor the inner repetition

txtql::check::empty_loop

